  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6e81416a-ecca-58cb-aba9-93a986427e2e" activityNameId="94beb7a0-0779-5a8a-a717-5642392b2187" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Production of carton board boxes, offset printing, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Production of carton board boxes, offset printing, at plant
The input of cartonboard is not included into this module allowing the user to establish its own cartonboard boxes. Per kg of used cartonboard, 0.83 kg of this module are needed.;
UUID: dad0a6c9-f4f4-3f9e-91f5-c89b3eb00826
This module includes the production of boxes out of cartonboard. It contains the steps of cutting, folding and printing with an offset machine and therefore inks and glues are considered as well as the electricity consumption.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average of the used technology within the examined Swiss producers
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dad0a6c9-f4f4-3f9e-91f5-c89b3eb00826.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
